cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper it implements."
title: "mhe-outlier-robust-v1: robust moving horizon estimation with a GARL-derivative stage cost"
abstract: >-
  Python and CasADi implementation of a moving horizon estimator whose stage cost is the square
  of the derivative of the General Adaptive Robust Loss, for agricultural vehicles whose GNSS
  measurements contain outliers.
license: MIT
type: software
authors:
